# BuggedBrain Placement OS & VTU SmartPrep AI: Technical & Product Documentation

Welcome to the comprehensive system documentation for the **BuggedBrain Placement OS** and **VTU SmartPrep AI** platform. This document outlines the application architecture, system workflows, target audience, core features, database design, and Gemini AI integration patterns.

---

## 🗺️ System Architecture Overview

The codebase represents a robust, modern Next.js monorepo that houses two primary user-facing systems:
1. **Placement OS (Career Workspace)**: A SaaS-grade portal enabling Class of 2026 students to build ATS-friendly resumes, optimize LinkedIn profiles, run mock interviews, check salary benchmarks, and track hiring applications.
2. **VTU SmartPrep AI (Sub-System)**: A specialized platform for Visvesvaraya Technological University (VTU) engineering students. It uses a Python FastAPI backend + Celery workers to parse previous year question papers (PYQs), calculate syllabus priority metrics, and serve syllabus-aligned RAG study aids.

