## 🎯 Target Audience (For Whom It Is)

The platform is purpose-built to address the transition from academic learning to professional employment:
* **Class of 2026 Tech Graduates**: Seeking Software Development, Frontend/Backend, AI/ML, Cloud/DevOps, or Cybersecurity roles.
* **Visvesvaraya Technological University (VTU) Students**: Looking for targeted exam preparation helpers (PYQ solutions, syllabus weighting metrics, AI tutoring).
* **Off-Campus Applicants**: Students looking for automated matches to MNC recruitment drives (TCS, Wipro, Infosys, Deloitte, Accenture) and startups.

