## 💾 Database Schema & Persistence Design

The system runs on a Supabase PostgreSQL backend with Row Level Security (RLS) policies enforcing tenant isolation.

| Table Name | Primary Purpose | Key Columns / JSON Schemas |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `profiles` | Stores student academic, target career parameters, and onboarding state | `user_id` (ref), `skills` (text[]), `raw_profile_data` (JSONB), `cgpa`, `graduation_year` |
| `placement_readiness` | Tracks dynamic readiness metrics | `pri_score`, `resume_score`, `interview_score`, `linkedin_score`, `placement_level` |
| `resume_scans` | Logs history of ATS evaluations | `user_id`, `resume_name`, `ats_score`, `role_fit_score`, `analysis` (JSONB) |
| `applications` | Recruiter CRM pipeline cards | `job_id` (ref), `status`, `salary`, `details` (JSONB for schedules, matchScores) |
| `roadmap_progress` | Interactive flowchart learning points | `roadmap_name`, `step_name`, `completed` (boolean) |
| `mentor_bookings` | 1-on-1 expert coaching logs | `mentor_name`, `session_type`, `booking_date`, `status` |
| `community_posts` | Student community forum | `title`, `content`, `upvotes`, `reports` |

